Browser-Agent/releases/assets/515323903","id":515323903,"node_id":"RA_kwDOT36Pkc4etzf_","name":"SHA256SUMS.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1545,"digest":"sha256:9928ae7cb8a1557b02d79c5c9690fb11934335be908b8b36694ea70c5ca33906","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-08-15T04:36:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T04:36:53Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/7757/Fan-Browser-Agent/releases/download/v0.4.3/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7757/Fan-Browser-Agent/tarball/v0.4.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7757/Fan-Browser-Agent/zipball/v0.4.3","body":"# Fan 0.4.3 — First public desktop release\n\nFan 0.4.3 is the first downloadable desktop release of the open-source Fan-Browser-Agent project. It bundles the Electron interface, embedded Chromium browser, and local Python agent runtime. Select a model provider and enter your own API key on first launch—no Fan product account is required.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> This preview release is not yet signed with an Apple Developer ID or a commercial Windows code-signing certificate. macOS Gatekeeper or Windows SmartScreen may display an unknown-developer warning. Download Fan only from this GitHub repository and verify the package with `SHA256SUMS.txt`.\n\n## Downloads\n\n- **macOS Apple Silicon (arm64):** `Fan-0.4.3-mac-arm64.dmg`\n- **macOS Intel:** `Fan-0.4.3-mac-x64.dmg`\n- **Windows x64:** `Fan-0.4.3-win-x64.exe` (recommended) or the MSI package\n- **Linux x64:** AppImage, DEB, and RPM packages\n\n## Highlights\n\n- A visible embedded browser with human-in-the-loop takeover.\n- Provider configuration for DeepSeek, Alibaba, Coding Plan, Ollama Cloud, and custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints.\n- Local Skills, MCP, plugins, scheduled tasks, multi-task workspaces, and local persistence.\n- GitHub Releases as the public update source. Windows and Linux support in-app updates; macOS opens the matching GitHub Release page until signing and notarization are available.\n- Removal of the Fan SaaS login gate, account dependency, messaging-platform delivery, and remote Skills marketplace.\n\n## Verify a download\n\nDownload `SHA256SUMS.txt` from this Release and compare the checksum of the installer before running it. For example:\n\n```bash\nsha256sum Fan-0.4.3-linux-x86_64.AppImage\n```\n\nOn macOS, use `shasum -a 256 <downloaded-file>`. On Windows PowerShell, use `Get-FileHash <downloaded-file> -Algorithm SHA256`.\n"}]